Ib Shade ~ Doom	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:A creature hit by its wracking touch is affected as by doom; it can also use doom as a spell-like ability.	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Ib Shade ~ Voiceless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Cannot speak; communicates in Ib by other means.	SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Being of Ib ~ Amorphous	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Defensive	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Not subject to critical hits or sneak attacks.
Being of Ib ~ Amphibious	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Breathes both air and water.
